stream-delta storage
Cognitive Graph Runtime
graph scheduler/run state/node contracts
memory/storage backends
embedding/rerank/retrieval capability execution
vision/multimodal capability execution
tool execution
per-action timeout scheduling
backend lane scheduling
worker/native execution changes
scheduler/request/lifecycle/stream changes
```

Docs intentionally use “bounded in-memory history/readback,” not durable storage.

